<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">导入账单</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">选一份微信导出的 CSV 或 xlsx，自动分出生意款、进货和私人往来</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <button class="btn primary" bindtap="chooseFile" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">
      选择账单文件
    </button>
    <view class="tip">
      支持 CSV 和 xlsx。微信导出的账单可能是加密 zip，密码是微信后六位，先解压再导入；也可以把文件发到「文件传输助手」，回这里选择。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{preview}}">
    <view class="card-title">
      <text>解析预览</text>
      <text class="hint">{{fileName}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">数据行</text><text class="value">{{preview.total_data_lines}}</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">成功解析</text><text class="value">{{preview.parsed}}</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">跳过</text><text class="value">{{preview.skipped}}</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">营业收款</text><text class="value">{{preview.business_income_total}}</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">退款</text><text class="value">{{preview.refund_total}}</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">未识别类型</text><text class="value">{{preview.unknown_type}} 笔</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">退款/已关闭</text><text class="value">{{preview.excluded}} 笔</text></view>
    <button class="btn primary" style="margin-top: 24rpx" bindtap="confirmImport" disabled="{{loading}}">
      确认导入
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{saved}}">
    <view class="card-title">导入完成</view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">本次处理</text><text class="value">{{saved.saved.total}} 笔</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">新增</text><text class="value">{{saved.saved.inserted}} 笔</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">覆盖重复</text><text class="value">{{saved.saved.updated}} 笔</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text class="label">待确认</text><text class="value">{{saved.pending.pending_peers}} 个对手方 / {{saved.pending.pending_count}} 笔</text></view>
    <view class="action-row">
      <button class="btn ghost half" bindtap="goPending">去确认</button>
      <button class="btn primary half" bindtap="goReport">看月报</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
